import PfaffianDescent.CubicClosedPointSerreZeroIdealStalkAwayNative
import PfaffianDescent.CubicClosedPointSerreZeroIdealStalkPullback

/-! # Actual point ideals and canonical Serre section stalk coordinates

The actual affine ideal localizes to its actual ideal-module stalk range,
to the original maximal ideal at the closed point, and to the unit ideal
off the support. These identities hold for the actual open-pullback ideal
in its literal open-scheme stalk. Off the support, the original canonical
Serre stalk section has a constructed actual linear left inverse, so its
coordinates in every rank-two basis generate the unit ideal.
-/
